--- .autoeda/runtime/results/stmap27/review_prompt2.txt
Second review for the stmap27 AutoEDA iteration after addressing review pass 1.

Pass 1 accepted finding:
- P2: stmap27 was included in the area-sensitive guard path, but Map_MatchStmap13CountRisk() still rejected fSkipFanout > 27, so stmap27 risk/profile counters did not populate.

Fix applied:
- src/map/mapper/mapperMatch.c now lets Map_MatchStmap13CountRisk() count modes through fSkipFanout=28.

Revalidation after the fix:
- make ABC_USE_NO_READLINE=1 passed.
- stmap27 -h passed.
- smoke on benchmarks/i10.aig passed.
- full baseline and candidate evaluation passed on all four required benchmarks.
- parsed metrics and diagnostics were regenerated.
- guard counters now populate for ode/or1200/syn2; syn2 records one signature-safe seed at node 24798 and two signature-block events at node 37979.
- CEC passed for all four required benchmarks.
- artifact_check.log passed after the fix.

Please review the current uncommitted diff and runtime artifacts for remaining correctness issues, especially mode-number gating, preservation of stmap0..stmap26 behavior, diagnostic consistency, and whether the accepted pass-1 finding was fully addressed. The final versions.md and campaign_state completion update will be written after this review so it can include your pass-2 findings.
